# CITATION.cff for the datazoom.amazonia R package.
# Enables GitHub's "Cite this repository" button. Keep in sync with
# DESCRIPTION when the version or authors change.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use datazoom.amazonia in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "datazoom.amazonia: Simplify Access to Data from the Amazon Region"
abstract: >-
  R package to download and process data on the Brazilian Amazon from official
  sources (IBGE, INPE, MapBiomas, IBAMA, ANEEL and others): deforestation and
  land use (PRODES, DETER, DEGRAD, MapBiomas), emissions (SEEG), climate,
  agricultural and livestock production (PAM, PPM, PEVS, Agricultural Census),
  mining (SIGMINE), energy and foreign trade, cleaned and standardized at the
  municipality, state and regional levels.
